<body>
    <h1>Employee Access Internal Standards</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>This page contains our interpretation of standards that are requ=
ired to be applied to CX.</p>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessInternalStandards-1.AccessRequestManagement">1. Acc=
ess Request Management</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Identifier</p></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Security requirement</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>All access issuance or removal must be carried out via the Bank=E2=
=80=99s access catalogue service.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>All access requests must be approved, documented, and retained for =
audit purposes.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-10</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Reactivation of a deactivated application account must be processed=
 as a new access request.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-PAM-05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Use of privileged access must be justified and documented for audit=
 purposes.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessInternalStandards-2.AccessProvisioning/Configuratio=
n">2. Access Provisioning / Configuration</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Identifier</p></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Security requirement</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-IDE-04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Every account must be associated with a unique digital identity.</p=
></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Users must have an account named in the corporate directory.</p></t=
d>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Accounts must be attributed to an owner and managed by identity lif=
ecycle.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Account owner must be identifiable using a correlation key.</p></td=
>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Naming convention must distinguish account types.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Generic or shared accounts are prohibited in production.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-06</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Accounts must not be cloned.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access rules must be documented in an access matrix.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-03</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access rights must be grouped into profiles and reviewed when modif=
ied.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-PAM-01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Privileged access must only be used when necessary.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-PAM-02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Privileged accounts must be restricted to intended systems.</p></td=
>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-PAM-04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Privileged accounts must not be used for non-privileged activities.=
</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessInternalStandards-3.EmployeeLogin/AccessEnforcement=
">3. Employee Login / Access Enforcement</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Identifier</p></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Security requirement</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access must be granted based on the principle of least privilege.</=
p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Authentication strength must match the level of risk.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-04</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Authentication must be federated where supported.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-05</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Login must not expose system or validation details.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-07</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Reauthentication is required after 15 minutes of inactivity.</p></t=
d>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-08</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Initial and reset passwords must be changed after first use.</p></t=
d>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-11</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Default credentials must be changed before production use.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-14</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Multifactor authentication must combine at least two factors.</p></=
td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHN-16</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Admin or emergency access must require level-3 assurance.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessInternalStandards-4.OngoingMonitoring&amp;Certifica=
tion">4. Ongoing Monitoring &amp; Certification</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Identifier</p></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Security requirement</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-09</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access must be certified at least once every 12 months.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-AUTHZ-10</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access must be recertified following role changes.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-12</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Orphaned accounts must be correlated or deactivated.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-PAM-07</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Privileged actions must be logged.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"EmployeeAccessInternalStandards-5.EmployeeOffboarding&amp;Deactiv=
ation">5. Employee Offboarding &amp; Deactivation</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Identifier</p></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">
     <p>Security requirement</p></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#44546f;">EIAM-CPT-07</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span>All user accounts in the corporate directory must be deactiva=
ted within 24 hours of the date of departure.</span></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#44546f;">EIAM-CPT-08</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;" class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>If a user is immediately terminated or suspended, their accounts mu=
st be deactivated according to the immediate termination process.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-11</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Dormant accounts must be deactivated after 90 days.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-02</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Account lifecycle must follow the identity lifecycle.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>EIAM-CPT-12</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Orphaned accounts must be deactivated if not correlated.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
------=_Part_86293_2041260243.1788185376950--
